('MIDDLE-05', 'Meet in the Middle', 'THE QUALITY-TIME CASE', 'More time is not always the same as more connection.', 'All relationships', 'COMMON_GROUND', 'free', 'DETERMINISTIC RULES', 'Define a realistic shared ritual that feels meaningful to both.', 4, 'Monthly', 'Medium', 'Launch', 'Choose a ritual both accept, within the lower capacity, and remove the highest-overlap blocker. Never frame quantity as proof of care.', '["aligned","type_gap","capacity_gap"]'::jsonb, 'No score shown', 'What You Need + What They Need + Where You Meet + Try This', 'Return clarify/no verdict when required answers are missing or safety gate triggers.', '{"inviteTitle":"A little middle ground?","inviteBody":"Your person invited you to work through the quality-time case together.","inviteCta":"Add Your Side","readyTitle":"The verdict is ready.","readyBody":"Both sides are in. Bunny Judge has ruled on THE QUALITY-TIME CASE.","readyCta":"Hear the Verdict","privacyNote":"No pressure to agree instantly. Start with your honest side."}'::jsonb),
('MIDDLE-06', 'Meet in the Middle', 'THE SOCIAL BATTERY CASE', 'One wants plans. One has three percent left.', 'All relationships', 'COMMON_GROUND', 'free', 'DETERMINISTIC RULES', 'Balance social activity, companionship and recovery.', 4, 'As needed', 'Low-Medium', 'Launch', 'Use the lower social battery as the capacity limit. Prefer a compromise explicitly accepted by both; otherwise allow separate plans without moral judgment.', '["aligned","bridge","short_plan"]'::jsonb, 'No score shown', 'What You Need + What They Need + Where You Meet + Try This', 'Return clarify/no verdict when required answers are missing or safety gate triggers.', '{"inviteTitle":"A little middle ground?","inviteBody":"Your person invited you to work through the social battery case together.","inviteCta":"Add Your Side","readyTitle":"The verdict is ready.","readyBody":"Both sides are in. Bunny Judge has ruled on THE SOCIAL BATTERY CASE.","readyCta":"Hear the Verdict","privacyNote":"No pressure to agree instantly. Start with your honest side."}'::jsonb),
('LOVE-F01', 'Love Court', 'THE TINY LOVE RECEIPTS', 'Which little things are doing suspiciously heavy emotional lifting?', 'Partner only', 'RULE_MATCH', 'free', 'DETERMINISTIC RULES', 'Match the affection each person naturally gives with what the other most notices.', 3, 'Monthly', 'Low', 'Free Launch', 'Compare A.give_style with B.receive_style and B.give_style with A.receive_style. Two matches = double_match; one match = one_match; zero matches = reroute. Court-Ordered Move uses each person’s available_move only when it matches the other person’s receive_style; otherwise use the closest selected receive style.', '["double_match","one_match","reroute"]'::jsonb, 'Internal case-specific score allowed; never a relationship score', 'What the Court Heard + Final Verdict + Court-Ordered Move', 'Return clarify/no verdict when required answers are missing or safety gate triggers.', '{"inviteTitle":"A case has been filed.","inviteBody":"Your person submitted their testimony for THE TINY LOVE RECEIPTS. The court needs your side.","inviteCta":"Testify Now","readyTitle":"The verdict is ready.","readyBody":"Both sides are in. Bunny Judge has ruled on THE TINY LOVE RECEIPTS.","readyCta":"Hear the Verdict","privacyNote":"No peeking. Your answers stay sealed until both sides finish."}'::jsonb),
('LOVE-F02', 'Love Court', 'THE MISS-YOU SIGNAL', 'How do you say ‘I miss you’ without necessarily saying it?', 'Partner only', 'RULE_MATCH', 'free', 'DETERMINISTIC RULES', 'Reveal each person’s low-pressure missing-you signal and preferred response.', 3, 'Monthly', 'Low', 'Free Launch', 'Compare each sent_signal with the other’s wanted_signal. Exact reciprocal matches = same_frequency; one compatible signal = quiet_match; no compatible signal = hidden_signal. Contact rhythm agreement refines the move but never becomes a closeness score.', '["same_frequency","quiet_match","hidden_signal"]'::jsonb, 'Internal case-specific score allowed; never a relationship score', 'What the Court Heard + Final Verdict + Court-Ordered Move', 'Return clarify/no verdict when required answers are missing or safety gate triggers.', '{"inviteTitle":"A case has been filed.","inviteBody":"Your person submitted their testimony for THE MISS-YOU SIGNAL. The court needs your side.","inviteCta":"Testify Now","readyTitle":"The verdict is ready.","readyBody":"Both sides are in. Bunny Judge has ruled on THE MISS-YOU SIGNAL.","readyCta":"Hear the Verdict","privacyNote":"No peeking. Your answers stay sealed until both sides finish."}'::jsonb),
('LOVE-F03', 'Love Court', 'THE DATE ENERGY AUDIT', 'Romance, but calibrated to the battery percentage you actually have.', 'Partner only', 'RULE_RECIPE', 'free', 'DETERMINISTIC RULES', 'Create a realistic date format from shared energy, budget and planning preferences.', 3, 'Weekly', 'Low', 'Free Launch', 'Use the lower shared budget ceiling, the lower shared energy level unless one selects surprise and the other can plan, and the highest available planning capacity. Output home_date, tiny_adventure or proper_date. Never recommend spending above either person’s selection.', '["home_date","tiny_adventure","proper_date"]'::jsonb, 'Internal case-specific score allowed; never a relationship score', 'What the Court Heard + Final Verdict + Court-Ordered Move', 'Return clarify/no verdict when required answers are missing or safety gate triggers.', '{"inviteTitle":"A case has been filed.","inviteBody":"Your person submitted their testimony for THE DATE ENERGY AUDIT. The court needs your side.","inviteCta":"Testify Now","readyTitle":"The verdict is ready.","readyBody":"Both sides are in. Bunny Judge has ruled on THE DATE ENERGY AUDIT.","readyCta":"Hear the Verdict","privacyNote":"No peeking. Your answers stay sealed until both sides finish."}'::jsonb),
('CLOSE-F01', 'Closeness Court', 'THE BAD-DAY CHEAT CODE', 'Skip the guessing. Find the response that actually helps.', 'All relationships', 'RULE_MATCH', 'free', 'DETERMINISTIC RULES', 'Match a person’s bad-day need with a response the other can confidently use.', 3, 'Monthly', 'Low-Medium', 'Free Launch', 'Pair each first_need with its fixed response template, block the selected avoid style, and apply reply_load. Same first_need = shared_manual; different but nonconflicting needs = two_manuals; either selects space or no_reply = soft_mode.', '["shared_manual","two_manuals","soft_mode"]'::jsonb, 'Internal case-specific score allowed; never a relationship score', 'What the Court Heard + Final Verdict + Court-Ordered Move', 'Return clarify/no verdict when required answers are missing or safety gate triggers.', '{"inviteTitle":"A case has been filed.","inviteBody":"Your person submitted their testimony for THE BAD-DAY CHEAT CODE. The court needs your side.","inviteCta":"Testify Now","readyTitle":"The verdict is ready.","readyBody":"Both sides are in. Bunny Judge has ruled on THE BAD-DAY CHEAT CODE.","readyCta":"Hear the Verdict","privacyNote":"No peeking. Your answers stay sealed until both sides finish."}'::jsonb),
('CLOSE-F02', 'Closeness Court', 'THE LITTLE THING RADAR', 'Can you detect what is quietly carrying their week?', 'All relationships', 'PREDICT_SCORE', 'free', 'DETERMINISTIC RULES', 'Test current everyday knowledge without turning misses into a relationship score.', 3, 'Weekly', 'Low', 'Free Launch', 'Score exact prediction matches across three dimensions. Three matches = radar_locked; one or two = signal_found; zero = fresh_lore. Never display a percentage, grade or relationship score. The result surfaces the most useful mismatch as a new detail.', '["radar_locked","signal_found","fresh_lore"]'::jsonb, 'Internal case-specific score allowed; never a relationship score', 'What the Court Heard + Final Verdict + Court-Ordered Move', 'Return clarify/no verdict when required answers are missing or safety gate triggers.', '{"inviteTitle":"A case has been filed.","inviteBody":"Your person submitted their testimony for THE LITTLE THING RADAR. The court needs your side.","inviteCta":"Testify Now","readyTitle":"The verdict is ready.","readyBody":"Both sides are in. Bunny Judge has ruled on THE LITTLE THING RADAR.","readyCta":"Hear the Verdict","privacyNote":"No peeking. Your answers stay sealed until both sides finish."}'::jsonb),
('CLOSE-F03', 'Closeness Court', 'THE QUIET CARE SETTINGS', 'How do you stay present when nobody has energy for a whole conversation?', 'All relationships', 'RULE_MATCH', 'free', 'DETERMINISTIC RULES', 'Find a mutually comfortable low-energy contact style.', 3, 'Monthly', 'Low', 'Free Launch', 'Match available_signal to the other person’s wanted_signal. Two matches = quiet_sync; one = one_easy_bridge; none or a selected none/warm_space pair = space_with_warmth. Return window becomes the fixed follow-up rule.', '["quiet_sync","one_easy_bridge","space_with_warmth"]'::jsonb, 'Internal case-specific score allowed; never a relationship score', 'What the Court Heard + Final Verdict + Court-Ordered Move', 'Return clarify/no verdict when required answers are missing or safety gate triggers.', '{"inviteTitle":"A case has been filed.","inviteBody":"Your person submitted their testimony for THE QUIET CARE SETTINGS. The court needs your side.","inviteCta":"Testify Now","readyTitle":"The verdict is ready.","readyBody":"Both sides are in. Bunny Judge has ruled on THE QUIET CARE SETTINGS.","readyCta":"Hear the Verdict","privacyNote":"No peeking. Your answers stay sealed until both sides finish."}'::jsonb),
('LIFE-F01', 'Life Court', 'THE TONIGHT BUTTON', 'Two tired people. One tiny plan. Court is now in session.', 'All relationships', 'RULE_RECIPE', 'free', 'DETERMINISTIC RULES', 'Turn current energy and availability into one realistic shared plan.', 3, 'Daily', 'Low', 'Free Launch', 'Use the lower battery level as the time ceiling, choose an overlapping location/channel, and apply the selected benefit. Output tiny_touchpoint, shared_reset or solo_reset. Never assign a call when either selects solo or text only.', '["tiny_touchpoint","shared_reset","solo_reset"]'::jsonb, 'Internal case-specific score allowed; never a relationship score', 'What the Court Heard + Final Verdict + Court-Ordered Move', 'Return clarify/no verdict when required answers are missing or safety gate triggers.', '{"inviteTitle":"A case has been filed.","inviteBody":"Your person submitted their testimony for THE TONIGHT BUTTON. The court needs your side.","inviteCta":"Testify Now","readyTitle":"The verdict is ready.","readyBody":"Both sides are in. Bunny Judge has ruled on THE TONIGHT BUTTON.","readyCta":"Hear the Verdict","privacyNote":"No peeking. Your answers stay sealed until both sides finish."}'::jsonb),
('LIFE-F02', 'Life Court', 'THE MICRO-DATE GENERATOR', 'Build a date small enough to survive real life.', 'Partners or close pairs who want shared time', 'RULE_RECIPE', 'free', 'DETERMINISTIC RULES', 'Generate a low-friction shared activity from time, setting and mood.', 3, 'Weekly', 'Low', 'Free Launch', 'Cross time, compatible habitat and vibe through a fixed activity matrix. If habitats do not overlap, use remote. If either time is 10 minutes, cap at 10. Output remote_microdate, quick_outing or slow_evening.', '["remote_microdate","quick_outing","slow_evening"]'::jsonb, 'Internal case-specific score allowed; never a relationship score', 'What the Court Heard + Final Verdict + Court-Ordered Move', 'Return clarify/no verdict when required answers are missing or safety gate triggers.', '{"inviteTitle":"A case has been filed.","inviteBody":"Your person submitted their testimony for THE MICRO-DATE GENERATOR. The court needs your side.","inviteCta":"Testify Now","readyTitle":"The verdict is ready.","readyBody":"Both sides are in. Bunny Judge has ruled on THE MICRO-DATE GENERATOR.","readyCta":"Hear the Verdict","privacyNote":"No peeking. Your answers stay sealed until both sides finish."}'::jsonb),
('LIFE-F03', 'Life Court', 'THE CHORE DRAFT', 'Domestic peace, now with legally questionable bunny arbitration.', 'Pairs who share a home or recurring chores', 'RULE_ASSIGN', 'free', 'DETERMINISTIC RULES', 'Assign one low-stakes chore fairly using dislike, capacity and recent turn-taking.', 3, 'Weekly', 'Low', 'Free Launch', 'Never assign a person’s top-hated chore when the other lists it as tolerable. Weight recent workload: if both agree one carried more, give that person first pick; if disputed or unknown, rotate. Output clean_swap, first_pick or rotation.', '["clean_swap","first_pick","rotation"]'::jsonb, 'Internal case-specific score allowed; never a relationship score', 'What the Court Heard + Final Verdict + Court-Ordered Move', 'Return clarify/no verdict when required answers are missing or safety gate triggers.', '{"inviteTitle":"A case has been filed.","inviteBody":"Your person submitted their testimony for THE CHORE DRAFT. The court needs your side.","inviteCta":"Testify Now","readyTitle":"The verdict is ready.","readyBody":"Both sides are in. Bunny Judge has ruled on THE CHORE DRAFT.","readyCta":"Hear the Verdict","privacyNote":"No peeking. Your answers stay sealed until both sides finish."}'::jsonb),
('MIDDLE-F01', 'Meet in the Middle', 'THE CHECK-IN SETTINGS', 'How much contact feels close without feeling like attendance?', 'All relationships', 'RULE_OVERLAP', 'free', 'DETERMINISTIC RULES', 'Find a sustainable check-in rhythm and channel without pressure.', 3, 'Monthly', 'Low', 'Free Launch', 'Choose the lower-frequency preference, the lowest-effort overlapping channel, and each person’s acceptable busy signal. Output same_settings, light_bridge or custom_settings. Never frame lower contact as lower care.', '["same_settings","light_bridge","custom_settings"]'::jsonb, 'No score shown', 'What You Need + What They Need + Where You Meet + Try This', 'Return clarify/no verdict when required answers are missing or safety gate triggers.', '{"inviteTitle":"A little middle ground?","inviteBody":"Your person invited you to work through the check-in settings together.","inviteCta":"Add Your Side","readyTitle":"The verdict is ready.","readyBody":"Both sides are in. Bunny Judge has ruled on THE CHECK-IN SETTINGS.","readyCta":"Hear the Verdict","privacyNote":"No pressure to agree instantly. Start with your honest side."}'::jsonb),
('MIDDLE-F02', 'Meet in the Middle', 'THE PLAN-CHANGE PROTOCOL', 'Because ‘actually, can we reschedule?’ should not start a crime documentary.', 'All relationships', 'RULE_PROTOCOL', 'free', 'DETERMINISTIC RULES', 'Create a fair low-stakes rescheduling protocol from notice, context and repair preferences.', 3, 'As needed', 'Low-Medium', 'Free Launch', 'Build a fixed protocol using the stricter notice preference, each person’s sting trigger and selected repair. Same repair = shared_protocol; compatible repairs = two_step; conflicting capacity = minimum_viable_repair. Never decide whether a cancellation was morally justified.', '["shared_protocol","two_step","minimum_viable_repair"]'::jsonb, 'No score shown', 'What You Need + What They Need + Where You Meet + Try This', 'Return clarify/no verdict when required answers are missing or safety gate triggers.', '{"inviteTitle":"A little middle ground?","inviteBody":"Your person invited you to work through the plan-change protocol together.","inviteCta":"Add Your Side","readyTitle":"The verdict is ready.","readyBody":"Both sides are in. Bunny Judge has ruled on THE PLAN-CHANGE PROTOCOL.","readyCta":"Hear the Verdict","privacyNote":"No pressure to agree instantly. Start with your honest side."}'::jsonb),
